# Linux System Administration History (1969–2026)

## Linux CLI, File System, Users, Processes, VIM, Scripting, Monitoring – Historical Timeline

Linux is the **most widely used operating system** for 
servers, cloud computing, DevOps, cybersecurity, AI infrastructure, and supercomputers. Most data centers, cloud platforms, and AI clusters run Linux.

