# Why Linux Matters Today

Linux powers:

* **100% of the world's Top500 supercomputers**
* The majority of cloud servers on AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud
* Most Kubernetes clusters
* Most AI training and inference servers
* Enterprise data centers and DevOps platforms

For careers in **Data Engineering, DevOps, 
Cloud Computing, Cybersecurity, AI Infrastructure, Machine Learning,
and Site Reliability Engineering**, Linux administration remains one of the most fundamental and valuable skills to master.
